#=GF RT   The structure of an ancient conserved domain establishes a
#=GF RT   structural basis for stable histidine phosphorylation and
#=GF RT   identifies a new family of adenosine-specific kinases.
#=GF RA   Lott JS, Paget B, Johnston JM, Delbaere LT, Sigrell-Simon JA,
#=GF RA   Banfield MJ, Baker EN;
